# VEIL OMNI - repository guard.
# The game assets are the one thing that must never be lost, and they are not
# something git should carry without LFS. Content, Saved and the packs stay on
# disk exactly as they are; this repository tracks the code that builds them.
Content/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Binaries/
Packaged/
Backup_veil_omni_install_*/
Backup_*/
Build/
.vs/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.log
*.uba
*.sav
*.bak*
*.phi-backup-*
